ission payment is not a visa guarantee.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/expansion-20261022/italy-siena-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-22\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-22\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/university-of-siena-admissions-scholarships/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the Siena application fee refundable if I am not selected?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The official admission-fee page describes it as non-refundable, regardless of the selection result.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does paying the fee guarantee a visa?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Siena explicitly states that the payment does not create a visa guarantee or right.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is DSU accommodation guaranteed?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The Siena scholarship page states that accommodation is subject to availability. Check the allocation result and prepare a backup budget.\"}}]}"}}]],["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero inner-hero--compact inner-hero--guide inner-hero--visual","children":"$L18"}],"$L19","$L1a"]}]
